  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Almost every <color=#8CC921>action</color> has a <color=#86CCF8>difficulty</color> level (from 1 to 20), which determines your <color=#86CCF8>chance</color> of success (%). Increase your Comfort</color> to improve your odds!


    Actions may require resources (<color=#EBDA80>AP</color>, <color=#8CC921>Will</color>, or <color=#86CCF8>Comfort</color>) to perform.

    These resources are <color=#E68A8A>always spent</color>, regardless of whether you succeed.

    <color=#86CCF8>Successful</color> actions may <color=#8CC921>reward</color> you with additional resources.

    but <color=#EBDA80>AP</color> cannot be replenished.


    Success is determined by rolling a <color=#EBDA80>d20</color> (yes, just like in DnD).

    The roll must meet or exceed the action''s difficulty level, after applying any <color=#86CCF8>bonuses</color>.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 125cb55b44b24c4393181402bc6200e6, type: 2}
